<title>BELGIUM: Belgian fund industry grew by 2.9 pct in Q3 1996.</title>
<headline>Belgian fund industry grew by 2.9 pct in Q3 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of funds under management by Belgium's unit trust industry grew 2.9 percent to 2,173 billion Belgian francs in the third quarter of 1996 from 2,112 billion francs at June 30, the Belgian Association of Collective Investment Organisations said on Friday.</p>
<p>Bond, money market and other fixed income funds accounted for 65 percent of the total under management at September 30. Equity linked and other variable income funds represented 35 percent.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
